{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 对部分人物动机和因果关系压缩过多，例如 S03 少了想确认对方是否也有同样感受，S13 弱化了明知无人能保证永远这一层自我认知，X 交代得更完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的话句更短，重点有醒目的视觉锚点，感受又能按音乐节点出现，边听边扫时更容易抓住每段在发生什么。小船、水波等意象反复回返，尾声还明确接回开头，形成了比 X 更鲜明的整体感；同时，Y 对旋律、声部、音色和情绪变化的描写更具体细腻。X 的人物心理动机交代更周全，但整体作为音乐视频的伴随屏幕，Y 更容易让观众同时获得故事和音乐两方面的信息。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6516adf3-c337-4984-8935-0271bca6f99f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T200838360281Z", "elapsed_seconds": 213.172, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T20:12:11.547633+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "31ddfbf17233e5bf695db9a52f51377bc18013f8379f71ceaed814fb7fd8b80a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools